OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a mixture of clear intervals and
OL,7,Foccasional showers through the night,
OL,8,Fsome heavy especially across Orkney. A
OL,9,Fmoderate to fresh westerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FAnother day of bright or
OL,12,Fsunny intervals and occasional
OL,13,Fshowers, some on the heavy side.
OL,14,FLighter winds for Shetland, a fresh
OL,15,Fwest to northwesterly over Orkney.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
