OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and isolated lighter showers
OL,7,Fon Sunday. Bright start Monday then
OL,8,Fcloudy with a little rain. Wet start
OL,9,FTuesday then sunshine and showers,
OL,10,Fgales.
